{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14823","headline":"詶崔侍御早秋卧病书情见寄时君亦抱疾在假中 · 卢纶","name":"詶崔侍御早秋卧病书情见寄时君亦抱疾在假中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掷地金声信有之，莹然冰玉见清词。\n元凯癖成官始贵，相如渴甚貌逾衰。\n荒园每觉虫鸣早，华馆常闻客散迟。\n寂寞罢琴风满树，几多黄叶落蛛丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}